{"ex-E402-1":{"id":"ex-E402-1","chapter":"E402","number":1,"title":"聲強度","question":"<p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span> 是點聲源。位置 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 與 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span> 相距 5 m。在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 量度得出的聲強度為4.5 × 10<sup>–6</sup> W m<sup>–2</sup>，求聲源 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的功率。</p>","answer":"<p>By <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>I</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>P</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>π</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>r</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math>,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>P</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = 4π<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>r</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup><mrow><mtext>I</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = 4π × 5<sup>2</sup> × (4.5 × 10<sup>−6</sup>) = 1.41 × 10<sup>−3</sup> W</p>","tips":"","think":"<p>如果聲源的功率加倍，X 處的聲強會如何改變？</p>","thinkAnswer":"<p>聲強加倍。在相同距離，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>I</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>P</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>π</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>r</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mtext>∝</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>P</mtext></mrow></mrow></math>，因此新的聲強為 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>I</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>new</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>(</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>×</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>−</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup><mrow><mtext>)</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>9</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>×</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>−</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>W m</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>−</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></math>。</p>","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E402_TN_ce_.pdf","sha256":"01d7fcb5f91e5125d3694fb152f5dbe19747c8f642685d17c40b3c5181b4e778","segments":[{"page":8,"kind":"question","box":[180.6491,53.49999511718738,557.6491,148.81585693359375],"text":"例 題 1 聲強度\r\nS 是 點 聲 源。位 置 X 與 S 相距 5 m。在 X 量度得出的聲強度為\r\n4.5 × 10–6 W m–2，求聲源 S 的功率。\r\n"},{"page":8,"kind":"answer","box":[180.6491,148.81585693359375,557.6491,238.85299511718745],"text":"題解\r\n根據 I = P\r\n4πr\r\n2，\r\nP = 4πr\r\n2\r\nI = 4π × 52 × (4.5 × 10–6) = 1.41 × 10–3 W\r\n"},{"page":8,"kind":"answer","box":[177.4488,227.85269511718752,560.4488,308.5666951171875],"text":"想一想\r\n如果聲源 S 的功率增至原來的兩倍，在位置 X 的聲強度會怎樣改變？\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":"Complete Chinese translation of the English supplementary answer","sharedMathematicalAnswer":true,"englishAlignedFields":["tips","think","thinkAnswer"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-E402-2":{"id":"ex-E402-2","chapter":"E402","number":2,"title":"聲強度（運用比例）","question":"<p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span> 是一個點聲源。位置 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span> 與 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的距離分別為 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 3<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span>。在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 量度得出的聲強度為 4.5 × 10<sup>–6</sup> W m<sup>–2</sup>，求在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span> 量度得出的聲強度。</p>","answer":"<p>根據 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span> ∝ <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{r^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span>，</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>Y</mi></msub><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>X</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{I_{Y}}{I_{X}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>X</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>Y</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{r_{X}^{2}}{r_{Y}^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>d</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{d^{2}}{(3d)^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{9}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>∴ <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>Y</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{Y}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{9}</annotation></semantics></math></span> × <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>X</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{X}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{9}</annotation></semantics></math></span> × (4.5 × 10<sup>–6</sup>) = 5 × 10<sup>–7</sup> W m<sup>–2</sup></p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E402_TN_ce_.pdf","sha256":"01d7fcb5f91e5125d3694fb152f5dbe19747c8f642685d17c40b3c5181b4e778","segments":[{"page":8,"kind":"question","box":[180.6491,334.3419951171875,557.6491,429.6576843261719],"text":"例 題 2 聲強度（運用比例）\r\nS 是一個點聲源。位置 X 和 Y 與 S 的距離分別為 d 和 3d。在 X 量度\r\n得出的聲強度為 4.5 × 10–6 W m–2，求在 Y 量度得出的聲強度。\r\n"},{"page":8,"kind":"answer","box":[180.6491,429.6576843261719,557.6491,562.3419951171875],"text":"題解\r\n根據 I ∝ \r\n1\r\nr\r\n2 ，\r\nIY\r\nIX\r\n = rX\r\n2\r\nrY\r\n2 = d2\r\n(3d)\r\n2 = 1\r\n9\r\n∴ IY = 1\r\n9\r\n× IX = 1\r\n9\r\n× (4.5 × 10–6) = 5 × 10–7 W m–2\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-E402-3":{"id":"ex-E402-3","chapter":"E402","number":3,"title":"聲強度和聲強級","question":"<p>艾威聽到從窗外傳來的聲音。已知：聽覺閾</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{0}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 10<sup>–12</sup> W m<sup>–2</sup></p><p>(a) 假設聲音到達艾威的耳朵時聲強度為10<sup>–7</sup> W m<sup>–2</sup>。艾威所聽到的聲強級是多少？</p><p>(b) 艾威走向窗戶，在窗戶旁邊停下。如果他聽到 60 dB 的聲音，他所接收到的聲強度是多少？</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/a2e17999dd6f845ee7b45f2f.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:184.9px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>L</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = 10 log (<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>I</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>I</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math>) = 10 log (<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>–</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>7</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>–</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math>) = 50 dB</p><p>(b) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>L</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = 10 log (<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>I</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>I</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math>)</p><p>60 = 10 log (<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>I</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>–</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math>)</p><p>6 = log (<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>I</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>–</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math>)</p><p>10<sup>6</sup> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>I</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>–</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>I</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = 10<sup>−6</sup> W m<sup>−2</sup></p>","tips":"<p>技巧</p><p>數學</p><p>對數（第 179 頁）</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E402_TN_ce_.pdf","sha256":"01d7fcb5f91e5125d3694fb152f5dbe19747c8f642685d17c40b3c5181b4e778","segments":[{"page":10,"kind":"question","box":[180.4491,53.49989511718741,557.4491,240.81585693359375],"text":"例 題 3 聲強度和聲強級\r\n艾威聽到從窗外傳來的聲音。已知：聽覺閾\r\nI0 = 10–12 W m–2\r\n(a) 假設聲音到達艾威的耳朵時聲強度為\r\n10–7 W m–2。艾威所聽到的聲強級是多少？\r\n(b) 艾威走向窗戶，在窗戶旁邊停下。如果他聽\r\n到 60 dB 的聲音，他所接收到的聲強度是\r\n多少？\r\n"},{"page":10,"kind":"answer","box":[180.4491,240.81585693359375,557.4491,467.3528951171875],"text":"題解\r\n(a) L = 10 log • I\r\nI0\r\n•\r\n= 10 log • 10–7\r\n10–12•\r\n= 50 dB\r\n(b) L = 10 log • I\r\nI0\r\n•\r\n 60 = 10 log • I\r\n10–12•\r\n 6 = log • I\r\n10–12•\r\n 106\r\n = I\r\n10–12\r\n I = 10 − 6\r\n W m\r\n− 2\r\n"},{"page":10,"kind":"tips","box":[40,49.49989511718741,176.4491,467.3528951171875],"text":"對 數 p.179\r\n技巧分析\r\n運 算\r\n技巧分析\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"sharedMathematicalAnswer":true,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-E402-4":{"id":"ex-E402-4","chapter":"E402","number":4,"title":"等響曲線","question":"<p>下圖顯示浩翔的一些等響曲線。</p><p>(a) 一個 40 dB 的 200 Hz 樂音，方數是多少？</p><p>(b) 一個 50 dB 的 100 Hz 樂音，與一個 40 dB 的 10 000 Hz 樂音，對浩翔來說哪個樂音的響度較大？</p><p>(c) 浩翔的耳朵對哪個頻率範圍的聲音較敏感，100–200 Hz 還是1000–2000 Hz？</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/44443c835d0dd1efc976c207.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:521.9px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 20</p><p>(b) 40 dB 的 10 000 Hz 樂音響度較大。</p><p>(c) 1000–2000 Hz</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>這是因為 200 Hz、40 dB 的聲音位於一條通過 1000 Hz、20 dB 聲音的曲線上。</p><p>提示</p><p>這是因為 100 Hz、50 dB 的聲音介乎 10 方與 20 方之間，而 10 000 Hz、40 dB 的聲音介乎 20 方與 30 方之間。</p><p>提示</p><p>這是因為等響曲線在此頻率範圍的部分較低，表示此頻率範圍的聲音只需較低的聲強級，便可產生相同的感知響度。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E402_TN_ce_.pdf","sha256":"01d7fcb5f91e5125d3694fb152f5dbe19747c8f642685d17c40b3c5181b4e778","segments":[{"page":13,"kind":"question","box":[185.4491,53.49989511718752,562.4491,452.2873840332031],"text":"例 題 4 等響曲線\r\n下圖顯示浩翔的一些等響曲線。\r\n20\r\n20\r\n10\r\n0\r\n30\r\n40\r\n50\r\n60\r\n70\r\n80\r\n90\r\n100\r\n50 100 200 500 1000 5000 10 000\r\n聲強級 / dB\r\n頻率 / Hz\r\n(a) 一個 40 dB 的 200 Hz 樂音，方數是多少？\r\n(b) 一個 50 dB 的 100 Hz 樂音，與一個 40 dB 的 10 000 Hz 樂音，\r\n對浩翔來說哪個樂音的響度較大？\r\n(c) 浩翔的耳朵對哪個頻率範圍的聲音較敏感，100–200 Hz 還是\r\n1000–2000 Hz？\r\n"},{"page":13,"kind":"answer","box":[185.4491,452.2873840332031,562.4491,560.3698951171875],"text":"題解\r\n(a) 20\r\n(b) 40 dB 的 10 000 Hz 樂音響度較大。\r\n(c) 1000–2000 Hz\r\n"},{"page":13,"kind":"tips","box":[40,49.49989511718752,181.4491,560.3698951171875],"text":"提提你\r\n這是因為等響曲線在這個頻\r\n率範圍處於較低的位置，表\r\n示在這個範圍以內的聲音只\r\n要較低的聲強級，聽起來的\r\n響度便會與較高聲強級的\r\n100–200Hz的聲音相同。提提你\r\n這是因為200 Hz 和40 dB\r\n的組合與1000 Hz 和20 dB\r\n的組合位於同一曲線上。\r\n提提你\r\n這是因為100 Hz 和50 dB\r\n的組合響度在10方和20方\r\n之 間，10 000 Hz 和40 dB\r\n的組合響度則在20方和\r\n30 方之間。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-E402-5":{"id":"ex-E402-5","chapter":"E402","number":5,"title":"聽力受損","question":"<p>下圖顯示詠怡及一個正常人的聽覺閾。</p><p>(a) 詠怡於低音調聲音還是高音調聲音的聽力受損較嚴重？</p><p>(b) 解釋 (a) 的答案。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/de6731435aee6d70390cfb43.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:413.9px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 低音調聲音</p><p>(b) 在低頻率部分，詠怡的聽覺閾曲線比正常人的聽覺閾曲線上移了很大的幅度，這表示她需要比正常人高很多的聲強級才能聽到低頻率聲音。</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E402_TN_ce_.pdf","sha256":"01d7fcb5f91e5125d3694fb152f5dbe19747c8f642685d17c40b3c5181b4e778","segments":[{"page":15,"kind":"question","box":[185.4491,53.49989511718752,562.4491,320.5566711425781],"text":"例 題 5 聽力受損\r\n下圖顯示詠怡及一個正常人的聽覺閾。\r\n聲強級\r\n頻率\r\n詠怡\r\n正常人\r\n(a) 詠怡於低音調聲音還是高音調聲音的聽力受損較嚴重？\r\n(b) 解釋 (a) 的答案。\r\n"},{"page":15,"kind":"answer","box":[185.4491,320.5566711425781,562.4491,435.0938951171875],"text":"題解\r\n(a) 低音調聲音\r\n(b) 在低頻率部分，詠怡的聽覺閾曲線比正常人的聽覺閾曲線上移了\r\n很大的幅度，這表示她需要比正常人高很多的聲強級才能聽到低\r\n頻率聲音。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-E402-7":{"id":"ex-E402-7","chapter":"E402","number":7,"title":"反射和透射的能量比重","question":"<p>超聲波脈衝如圖所示向脾臟傳播。脂肪和脾臟的聲阻抗分別為 1.38 × 10<sup>6</sup> kg m<sup>–2</sup> s<sup>–1</sup> 和1.65 × 10<sup>6</sup> kg m<sup>–2</sup> s<sup>–1</sup>。</p><p>(a) 求界面 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的反射聲強係數。</p><p>(b) 如果脈衝正向入射界面 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span>，求以下能量佔的比重：(i) 反射脈衝，(ii) 透射脈衝。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/a909239f722efb34d0f44b25.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:168.7px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) α = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{(Z_{2} - Z_{1})^{2}}{(Z_{2} + Z_{1})^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1.65</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1.38</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1.65</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1.38</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{(1.65 \\times  10^{6} - 1.38 \\times  10^{6})^{2}}{(1.65 \\times  10^{6} + 1.38 \\times  10^{6})^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0.007 94</p><p>(b) (i) 反射能量佔比 = α = 0.007 94</p><p>(ii) 透射能量佔比 = 1 – α = 1 – 0.007 94 = 0.992 06</p>","tips":"","think":"<p>1 界面 Q 的聲強反射系數是多少？</p><p>2 如果入射到界面 P 的超聲脈衝聲強為 100 W m<sup>-2</sup>，反射脈衝與透射脈衝的聲強分別是多少？</p>","thinkAnswer":"<p>1 Q 是脾臟與脂肪的界面。交換兩者的阻抗不會改變 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>α</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>(</mtext></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>Z</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mtext>−</mtext></mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>Z</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>Z</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mtext>+</mtext></mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>Z</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mfrac><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>)</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></math>。因此 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>α</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>Q</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>7</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>9</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow></mrow></math>，與 P 相同。</p><p>2 正入射時，忽略界面的吸收，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>I</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>r</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>α</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>I</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>7</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>9</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>×</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>7</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>9</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>W m</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>−</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></math> 及 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>I</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>t</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>(</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>−</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>α</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>)</mtext></mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>I</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>9</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>9</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>×</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>9</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>9</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>W m</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>−</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></math>。</p>","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E402_TN_ce_.pdf","sha256":"01d7fcb5f91e5125d3694fb152f5dbe19747c8f642685d17c40b3c5181b4e778","segments":[{"page":25,"kind":"question","box":[185.4491,53.49989511718741,562.4491,290.8158874511719],"text":"例 題 7 反射和透射的能量比重\r\n超聲波脈衝如圖所示向脾臟傳播。脂肪和脾\r\n臟的聲阻抗分別為 1.38 × 106\r\n kg m–2 s–1 和\r\n1.65 × 106\r\n kg m–2 s–1。\r\n(a) 求界面 P 的反射聲強係數。\r\n(b) 如果脈衝正向入射界面 P，求以下能量佔\r\n的比重：(i) 反射脈衝，(ii) 透射脈衝。\r\n"},{"page":25,"kind":"answer","box":[185.4491,290.8158874511719,562.4491,407.3528951171875],"text":"題解\r\n(a) α = (Z2 – Z1)\r\n2\r\n(Z2 + Z1)\r\n2 = (1.65 × 106\r\n – 1.38 × 106\r\n)\r\n2\r\n(1.65 × 106 + 1.38 × 106\r\n)\r\n2\r\n = 0.007 94\r\n(b) (i) 反射能量佔比 = α = 0.007 94\r\n (ii) 透射能量佔比 = 1 – α = 1 – 0.007 94 = 0.992 06\r\nP\r\nQ \r\n脂肪\r\n換能器\r\n脾臟\r\n"},{"page":25,"kind":"answer","box":[182.4488,396.3525951171875,565.4488,504.0825951171875],"text":"想一想\r\n1 界面 Q 的反射聲強係數是多少？\r\n2 如果入射界面 P 的超聲波脈衝強度為 100 W m–2，反射脈衝和透\r\n射脈衝的強度分別是多少？\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":"Complete Chinese translation of the English supplementary answer","englishAlignedFields":["think","tips","thinkAnswer"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-E402-8":{"id":"ex-E402-8","chapter":"E402","number":8,"title":"深度和厚度","question":"<p>換能器如圖所示在時間 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0 發出超聲波脈衝。換能器分別在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 15.4 μs 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 21.2 μs 探測到從界面 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span> 反射的回聲。假設超聲波沿傳播路徑的速率為 1550 m s<sup>–1</sup>。</p><p>(a) 求界面 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> 距離換能器的深度（以 mm 表示）。</p><p>(b) 求界面 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span> 之間結構的厚度（以 mm 表示）。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/c5172e4eaf5aef30f8a230f9.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:143.4px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>d</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mtext>c</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>t</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> × 1550 × (15.4 × 10<sup>–6</sup>) = 0.0119 m = 11.9 mm</p><p>(b) Δ<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>d</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mtext>c</mtext></mrow></mrow></math>Δ<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>t</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> × 1550 × (21.2 × 10<sup>–6</sup> – 15.4 × 10<sup>–6</sup>) = 0.004 50 m = 4.50 mm</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E402_TN_ce_.pdf","sha256":"01d7fcb5f91e5125d3694fb152f5dbe19747c8f642685d17c40b3c5181b4e778","segments":[{"page":30,"kind":"question","box":[47.0001,53.49989511718752,557.4491,214.81585693359375],"text":"例 題 8 深度和厚度\r\n換能器如圖所示在時間 t = 0 發出超聲波脈衝。換能器分別在 t = 15.4 μs\r\n和 t = 21.2 μs 探測到從界面 A 和 B 反射的回聲。假設超聲波沿傳播路徑\r\n的速率為 1550 m s–1。\r\n(a) 求界面 A 距離換能器的深度（以 mm 表示）。\r\n(b) 求界面 A 和 B 之間結構的厚度（以 mm 表示）。\r\n"},{"page":30,"kind":"answer","box":[47.0001,214.81585693359375,557.4491,317.4978951171875],"text":"題解\r\n(a) d = 1\r\n2\r\nct = 1\r\n2\r\n× 1550 × (15.4 × 10–6) = 0.0119 m = 11.9 mm\r\n(b) Δd = 1\r\n2\r\ncΔt = 1\r\n2\r\n× 1550 × (21.2 × 10–6 – 15.4 × 10–6) = 0.004 50 m = 4.50 mm\r\nA\r\nB\r\n換能器\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"sharedMathematicalAnswer":true,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-E402-9":{"id":"ex-E402-9","chapter":"E402","number":9,"title":"找出結構的厚度","question":"<p>病人正接受眼睛超聲波掃描（圖 a）。圖 b 顯示所得的 A-掃描影像。</p><p>A B C D</p><p>0 5 10 15 20 25 30 時間 / µs 圖 a 圖 b</p><p>假設超聲波在眼睛的傳播速率為 1550 m s<sup>–1</sup>。</p><p>(a) 波尖 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span> 對應視網膜。求視網膜和換能器之間的距離（以 mm 表示）。</p><p>(b) (i) 哪個波尖對應晶體的前表面？哪個對應後表面？</p><p>(ii) 求晶體的厚度（以 mm 表示）。</p><p class=\"study-figure\">